Scope note

This license covers the original work in this repository: the SNES runtime,
PPU and APU cores, frontends, presenters, overlay, configuration, tools, tests
and documentation.

It does not cover, and grants no rights to, Contra III: The Alien Wars itself.
No ROM image is included. The generated files src/bank_*.c and src/dispatch.c
are a mechanical translation of Konami's program code, provided for study,
interoperability and preservation. Contra and Contra III: The Alien Wars are
trademarks of Konami Digital Entertainment. This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Konami. To play, you need your own legally obtained copy
of the game.
